@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix demo: <https://demo.example/> .

# Receiver B already had its own node for the SAME release, under a different IRI.
<https://b.example/bobbin-release> a demo:Release ; rdfs:label "bobbin-release" .
